OL,3,GNEWSALake District littering 'creating
OL,4,Ano-go areas'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Lake District National Park
OL,7,FAuthority has been taking measures to
OL,8,Fcombat the problem, including a "leave
OL,9,Fno trace" branded bin bag campaign over
OL,10,Fthe summer.
